<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2340_8959.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser freundtlich willig dienst
<lb n="2"/>zuvor, Ehrnveste, Fuersichtige Eerbare
<lb n="3"/>und weise, besonders liebe und guote
<lb n="4"/>Freündt.
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Deroselben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerbeantwortliche</unclear> inter-
<lb n="6"/>cessionales, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beruerende</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angehoerig</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burger</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ferdinand</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Felen</unclear></persName>, sambt den
<lb n="8"/>beÿlag, haben wir verschinen tagen,
<lb n="9"/>empfangen, und ablesendt guotßame
<lb n="10"/>verstanden, auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ermanglet</unclear>,
<lb n="11"/>den unserigen solches zu seiner erinner-
<lb n="12"/>ung, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alßbaldt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einhendigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zulassen</unclear>,
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welcher</unclear> hierauf wider <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> uns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschinen</unclear>,
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegenbricht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethun</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">substanzlich</unclear> aber auf sein <persName resp="#ner">Felen</persName> per-
<lb n="16"/>sonliche einstellung und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegenwuor</unclear>-
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tigkeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrungen</unclear>, und
<lb n="18"/>deßwegen an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. umb
<lb n="19"/>unser anderwertige fuerschrift,
<lb n="20"/>nit allein den ihrigen oberkeitlich
<lb n="21"/>dahin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvermoegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beeden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einen</unclear> tag <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubestimen</unclear>,
<lb n="23"/>gantz eynstendig gebetten.
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wiewol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nun</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. für
<lb n="25"/>ihne <persName resp="#ner">Felen</persName> gethunes intercedieren,
<lb n="26"/>in dem daß er die sach durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seiner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eingebrachter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrift</unclear> be-
<lb n="28"/>nambsete Persohn, oder ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andern</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">qualificierte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anwald</unclear>, vor unsern
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2340_8960.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="30"/>iren respectivè Vettern
<lb n="31"/>der thayls <placeName resp="#ner">Beßbüehl</placeName>. Weil
<lb n="32"/>aber dises procedieren unserm Statt
<lb n="33"/>satzungen und ordnungen strackhs
<lb n="34"/>zuwider laufft, uberdiß wir den
<lb n="35"/>handel ohnediß so gestaltet befindt, daß
<lb n="36"/>deß <persName resp="#ner">Halers</persName> persöhnliche praesenz zu schleiniger eroerterung und
<lb n="37"/>abschneidung weitlaeuffigkeit, ne-
<lb n="38"/>ben ihme <persName resp="#ner">Haler</persName> besorgender unkoestung
<lb n="39"/>vil mehr fruchtbarlich und
<lb n="40"/>gedeylich sein werde, weder aber
<lb n="41"/>wann man dergleich anwald-
<lb n="42"/>schafften sich gebrauchen wurde.
<lb n="43"/>Deßhalben wir dem Anfangen
<lb n="44"/>seiner nit unzimliche Pitt ge-
<lb n="45"/>willfahret, und <persName resp="#ner">Haler</persName>
<lb n="46"/>darauff ihme baide newe Rechts-
<lb n="47"/>tag bestimbt, bestimmen und er-
<lb n="48"/>nennen ihme hiemit auff <date resp="#ner">Mon-
<lb n="49"/>tags Mentag den andern nechst-
<lb n="50"/>angehenden Monats tag Julij</date> alts
<lb n="51"/>Calenders alhie vor unserm Statt-
<lb n="52"/>gricht, alß daselbst-
<lb n="53"/>hi dise Rechtssach ghoerig, und albe-
<lb n="54"/>reit Rechtsanhengig gemacht ist.
<lb n="55"/>Gelangt dem allem nach an E. E.
<lb n="56"/>W. L. u. G. unser freundtlichs
<lb n="57"/>begern und ersuechen, dieselben
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2340_8961.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geliebe</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mehrermeltem</unclear>
<lb n="59"/>ihrem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angehoerigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burgern</unclear>, disen
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernanten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tag</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzekünden</unclear>, sonder
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darbeij</unclear> auch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nohmalen</unclear> mit allem
<lb n="62"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">oberkeitlichem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ernst</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihne</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zur</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebürr</unclear>
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dergstalt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anzeweißen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> er
<lb n="64"/>sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nunmehr</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ohne</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ferners</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ußbleiben</unclear>
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obgemeltem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsers</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stattgrichts</unclear>
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weder</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">persoendlih</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erscheine</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stelle</unclear>,
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethanes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versprechen</unclear> und das recht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angefangener</unclear>
<lb n="68"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußüebe</unclear>.
<lb n="69"/>Das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gereiht</unclear> zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befuerderung</unclear> der
<lb n="70"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">justici</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sind</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">es</unclear> umb
<lb n="71"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fr</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nl</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glihen</unclear>
<lb n="72"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">andern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begebenden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fählen</unclear>,
<lb n="73"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeerwideren</unclear>, willigen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erabiets</unclear>.
<lb n="74"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Damit</unclear> uns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beederseits</unclear> gottes
<lb n="75"/>obhalt wol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bevelhende</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dat</unclear>.
